      ],
      "requirement": "Treat 2175F as a complete five-block Darwin ALS despite its F suffix. The Lubbock/Bate report is orally received, and Darwin asks detailed questions about species, specimen, insertion duration/depth and reproductive outcome; his request to forward the note is prospective. Keep the 30 November/1 December cover/postmark distinction from the 29 November composition. Bishop-to-Bate 2179 remains a separate recovery candidate, not an automatically delivered Darwin prompt or Darwin voice.",
